{"ticker":"WDAY","updated":"2026-10-30T23:22:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Workday, Inc.","shortName":"Workday, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.workday.com","fullTimeEmployees":20896,"marketCap":47674621952,"trailingPE":40.289207,"forwardPE":14.937749,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":4.6946945,"pegRatio":0.59,"targetMeanPrice":209.25323,"targetHighPrice":275.0,"targetLowPrice":92.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.128,"earningsGrowth":2.06,"grossMargins":0.75795,"operatingMargins":0.11816,"profitMargins":0.12319,"totalRevenue":10154999808,"beta":1.074,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":241.32,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":110.36,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Workday, Inc. provides enterprise cloud applications in the United States and internationally. The company offers a suite of financial management applications to maintain accounting information; manage financial processes, such as payables and receivables; identify real-time financial, operational, and management insights; perform financial consolidation; reduce time-to-close; promote internal control and auditability; and achieve consistency across finance operations. It also provides spend management solutions that help organizations to streamline supplier selection and contract management, build and execute sourcing events, such as requests for proposals, and manage indirect spend; expense management solutions to submit and approve expenses; and a suite of human capital management applications that enables HR teams to hire, onboard, pay, develop, reskill, and provide employee experiences. In addition, the company offers planning applications. Further, it provides supply chain and inventory solutions to healthcare organizations; solutions to manage the end-to-end student and faculty lifecycle; Workday Extend for customers and their developers to build custom applications. The company serves the professional and business services, financial services, healthcare, manufacturing, media, education, government, technology, media, retail, and hospitality industries. It sells its sol","summary_zh":"Workday, Inc. 在美國和國際上提供企業雲端應用程式。該公司提供一套財務管理應用程式來維護會計資訊；管理財務流程，例如應付帳款和應收帳款；識別即時財務、營運和管理見解；進行財務合併；減少成交時間；促進內部控制和審計；並實現整個財務營運的一致性。它還提供支出管理解決方案，幫助組織簡化供應商選擇和合約管理、建立和執行採購活動（例如徵求建議書）以及管理間接支出；用於提交和批准費用的費用管理解決方案；以及一套人力資本管理應用程序，使人力資源團隊能夠招聘、入職、支付工資、開發、再培訓和提供員工體驗。此外，該公司還提供規劃應用程式。此外，它還為醫療保健組織提供供應鏈和庫存解決方案；管理端到端學生和教師生命週期的解決方案； Workday Extend 供客戶及其開發人員建立自訂應用程式。該公司為專業和商業服務、金融服務、醫療保健、製造、媒體、教育、政府、科技、媒體、零售和酒店業提供服務。它出售其溶膠","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":227.49,"h":229.41,"l":226.35,"c":228.89,"v":3936900},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":229.1,"h":235.32,"l":229.1,"c":233.43,"v":3529000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":231.95,"h":232.19,"l":227.0,"c":231.13,"v":2226800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":233.0,"h":237.5,"l":230.0,"c":231.08,"v":3526200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":231.62,"h":233.45,"l":229.1,"c":231.81,"v":3020200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":232.16,"h":233.57,"l":229.66,"c":230.73,"v":1904600},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":231.15,"h":231.79,"l":223.77,"c":226.48,"v":2863500},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":226.83,"h":228.57,"l":224.61,"c":226.67,"v":2272400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":226.17,"h":227.36,"l":222.11,"c":223.39,"v":2683200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":222.71,"h":224.91,"l":220.43,"c":222.75,"v":2404500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":222.75,"h":224.41,"l":218.0,"c":219.01,"v":3105100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":235.39,"h":240.63,"l":231.94,"c":234.88,"v":11662900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":237.68,"h":239.29,"l":231.3,"c":233.5,"v":4383800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":236.13,"h":237.75,"l":230.87,"c":233.62,"v":5925700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":232.02,"h":243.07,"l":230.73,"c":242.66,"v":4622600},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":241.99,"h":244.72,"l":239.51,"c":240.32,"v":3739200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":240.51,"h":243.32,"l":238.14,"c":241.51,"v":2147000},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":240.72,"h":243.08,"l":2