/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPZjFVZmw3cEFVQUJNcmZjaTBGbDVTTFZfYjlHSlFoQUtxRGdYTUtlU2htdDlCZGtTWUhwbFVMUXBxeHkzdTFReEVVa0Jrd0I1MjJrYjFEUXRlLXpkNnhVSWc4bkNrMFhNQVlGV3lsQ0U3LWtXalJxOTJNZ1RkbUMtQjdsbWU3UkZvODNLWXBldFlQdDREVVNoRXpkZEFNWmloeVlSOUt6aw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"ASGN (EFOR) 在第三季財報電話會議上所說的內容"},{"title":"By government order, companies in this neighboring country will have to record employees’ work hours starting January 1, 2027","src":"El Cronista","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"根據政府命令，該鄰國的公司必須從 2027 年 1 月 1 日起記錄員工的工作時間"},{"title":"Workday Shares Slide Over 6% Amid Broader Software Sector Retreat : 기업주식정보 : JKN","src":"재경일보","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE5abWZYMHcydTMxc3ByRFV6b0FkbG4xM3R3WU45Tno2TUo1ejNLYnJzYXVkWTRRRkFvLWkzOXo3WWFQcmwzNFVwQTV3M1cybkoxNUtMUGRmV1JaVUVJWV80T1NR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"在更廣泛的軟體產業撤退之際，Workday 股價下跌超過 6% : 기업주식정보 : JKN"},{"title":"Workday vice president: Don’t just chase promotions for a title change","src":"City AM","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPSGtZZUkxZU9wYjJPcEFOUXBZMjc5N2U4aHUtNGdjelNOaUs3TVNuNE8zQnl0cXdIZzgyeGlQS2xSSzJJaHdHTWNtOEZoQXNjeUs3SENzRms1UHNRcGJ2TkU1Tmw3UHY3eUFIMG9maFUtZVhJTng4WncyRUk0THhHOWxyTEVld2ZLbGVFNjhYcTJwd2hUTFJF?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"Workday 副總裁：不要只為了換頭銜而追求升職"},{"title":"ServiceNow stock drops 19% as slower contract g...","src":"Pluang","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPaG8yNXE3R250Qm1Kb0ZXNnN2Zlg4NnBqZ0lBS1oxenh0S2VXWVpWT3hZQ0tGelcwcVFQNi1WYmVjR2pnMkxCS191MkZZUmtnQVhBUHdSNkZOTF9RUXpjbVk2eElJckxNM0VnYkNTZWMzalBBc21iTnZBdExRU2QzaWpIVURLendmYkt6NFh3UFpyNHVpcXlTd0NpMDIza2p2UWZlMmJKeHA1UFZMWUE?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":"由於合約成長放緩，ServiceNow 股價下跌 19%"}],"themes":[{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":3},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"能源/電力","count":1},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-06","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1327811/000132781126000014/wday-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Workday is the enterprise AI platform for managing people, money, and agents. Workday provides more than 11,500 organizations with cloud solutions powered by artificial intelligence (\"AI\") to help solve some of today's most complex business challenges, including supporting and empowering their workforce, managing their finances and spend in an ever-changing environment, and planning for the unexpected.","zh":"Workday 是用於管理人員、資金和代理商的企業人工智慧平台。 Workday 為超過 11,500 家組織提供由人工智慧 (「AI」) 驅動的雲端解決方案，協助解決當今一些最複雜的業務挑戰，包括支援和增強員工能力、在不斷變化的環境中管理財務和支出，以及針對意外情況進行規劃。"},{"en":"We strive to reimagine how work gets done and hope to empower customers to do the same through an innovative suite of solutions with more than 75 million users under contract around the world and across industries – from emerging and medium-sized businesses to more than 65% of the Fortune 500. Central to our purpose is a set of core values – with our employees as number one – along with customer service, innovation, integrity, fun, and profitability. We believe that happy employees lead to happy customers, and we are committed to helping our customers adapt and thrive in this increasingly dynamic business environment.","zh":"我們努力重新構想工作的完成方式，並希望透過一套創新的解決方案讓客戶也能做到同樣的事情，與全球各地和各行業的超過 7500 萬簽約用戶（從新興和中型企業到財富 500 強企業的 65% 以上）。我們目標的核心是一系列核心價值（以員工為先）以及客戶服務、創新、誠信、樂趣和獲利能力。我們相信快樂的員工會帶來快樂的客戶，我們致力於幫助我們的客戶適應這個日益動態的商業環境並蓬勃發展。"},{"en":"As organizations face changing conditions, we believe the need for an intuitive, open, scalable, and secure platform that provides unified management of human resources (\"HR\"), finances, AI agents, suppliers, and planning is more important than ever. Workday AI is built into our platform, allowing us to rapidly deliver and sustain models that can transform business processes and solve countless business problems. Workday's insight into how people, money, and agents move through organizations provides a depth of context in HR and finance, allowing us to understand how and where work gets done and to strategically design solutions to have the greatest impact. As a result, Workday helps deliver better employee experiences, increase productivity, improve operational efficiencies, and provide insights for faster, data-driven decision-making. In fiscal 2026, we introduced new Workday AI agents","zh":"隨著組織面臨不斷變化的條件，我們認為，對一個直觀、開放、可擴展和安全的平台的需求比以往任何時候都更加重要，該平台可以提供人力資源（「HR」）、財務、人工智慧代理商、供應商和規劃的統一管理。 Workday AI 內建於我們的平台中，使我們能夠快速交付和維持可以改變業務流程並解決無數業務問題的模型。 Workday 對人員、資金和代理如何在組織中流動的洞察提供了人力資源和財務方面的深度背景，使我們能夠了解工作如何以及在哪裡完成，並策略性地設計解決方案以產生最大的影響。因此，Workday 有助於提供更好的員工體驗、提高生產力、提高營運效率，並為更快的數據驅動決策提供見解。在 2026 財年，我們推出了新的 Workday AI 代理"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"We sell our subscription contracts and related services and solutions globally through direct sales, through our sales partners, and over Workday Marketplace. Our direct sales organization consists of field sales and field sales support personnel, and the Workday Field Sales team is aligned by geography, industry, and/or customer size. We also segment our sales teams into two distinct groups: those focused on landing new customer relationships, and those focused on expanding our relationship within our existing customers. We generate customer leads, accelerate sales opportunities, and build brand awareness through our marketing programs and strategic relationships. Our marketing programs largely target senior business leaders, including CFOs, CHROs, and CIOs. We also generate customer leads and transact through our partner ecosystem, including through resellers.","zh":"我們透過直接銷售、我們的銷售合作夥伴以及 Workday Marketplace 在全球銷售我們的訂閱合約以及相關服務和解決方案。我們的直銷組織由現場銷售和現場銷售支援人員組成，Workday 現場銷售團隊根據地理位置、行業和/或客戶規模進行協調。我們也將我們的銷售團隊分為兩個不同的群組：專注於建立新客戶關係的團隊，以及專注於擴大我們與現有客戶的關係的團隊。我們透過行銷計劃和策略關係創造客戶線索、加速銷售機會並建立品牌知名度。我們的行銷計劃主要針對高階商業領袖，包括財務長、首席人力資源長和資訊長。我們也透過我們的合作夥伴生態系統（包括透過經銷商）產生客戶線索並進行交易。"},{"en":"Our sales strategy is focused on both adding new customers and on growing our relationships with our existing customers to expand the adoption of our suite of solutions over time. By extending our go-to-market capabilities globally, we aim to grow our business by selling to new customers in new regions. As our customers realize the benefits of our entire suite of service offerings, we aim to upgrade the customers' experience with new products and features, and gain additional subscriptions by targeting new functional areas and business units. For example, in fiscal 2026, we introduced Flex Credits, a new subscription-based flexible pricing model for certain AI solutions and platform capabilities, designed to make AI use simple, flexible, and scalable for our customers.","zh":"我們的銷售策略專注於增加新客戶以及發展與現有客戶的關係，以隨著時間的推移擴大我們解決方案套件的採用範圍。透過在全球範圍內擴展我們的進入市場能力，我們的目標是透過向新地區的新客戶銷售產品來發展我們的業務。當我們的客戶意識到我們整套服務產品的優勢時，我們的目標是透過新產品和功能升級客戶的體驗，並透過瞄準新的功能領域和業務部門來獲得更多訂閱。例如，在 2026 財年，我們推出了 Flex Credits，這是一種針對某些 AI 解決方案和平台功能的新的基於訂閱的靈活定價模型，旨在讓客戶能夠簡單、靈活且可擴展地使用 AI。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The overall market for enterprise application software, including AI-powered solutions, is rapidly evolving, highly competitive, and subject to changing technology, shifting customer needs, and frequent introductions of new products. We currently compete with large, well-established, enterprise software vendors, such as Oracle Corporation (\"Oracle\") and SAP SE (\"SAP\"). We also face competition from other enterprise software vendors, from regional competitors that only operate in certain geographic markets, from vendors of specific applications that address only one or a portion of our applications, and from vendors that specialize in specific industries in which we provide services, some of which offer cloud-based or AI-powered solutions. These vendors include, without limitation, Anaplan, Inc.; ADP; Coupa Software Inc.; Dayforce, Inc.; Microsoft; NetSuite; ServiceNow, Inc.; and UKG Inc.","zh":"包括人工智慧驅動的解決方案在內的企業應用軟體的整體市場正在快速發展，競爭激烈，並受到技術變化、客戶需求變化和新產品頻繁推出的影響。目前，我們與 Oracle Corporation（「Oracle」）和 SAP SE（「SAP」）等大型、成熟的企業軟體供應商競爭。我們還面臨來自其他企業軟體供應商的競爭，來自僅在某些地理市場運營的區域競爭對手，來自僅解決我們的一個或部分應用程式的特定應用程式供應商的競爭，以及來自專門從事我們提供服務的特定行業的供應商的競爭，其中一些供應商提供基於雲端或人工智慧驅動的解決方案。這些供應商包括但不限於 Anaplan, Inc.； ADP；庫帕軟體公司； Dayforce 公司；微軟;網路套件；現在服務公司；和 UKG 公司"},{"en":"In addition, other cloud or AI platform companies that provide services in different target markets or industries may develop applications or acquire companies that operate in our target markets or industries, and some potential customers may elect to develop their own internal applications. However, the domain and industry expertise that is required for a successful solution in the areas of financial management and HCM may inhibit new entrants, who may also be unable to invest the necessary capital to accurately address global requirements and regulations. We expect continued consolidation in our industry that could lead to significantly increased competition.","zh":"此外，在不同目標市場或行業提供服務的其他雲端或人工智慧平台公司可能會開發應用程式或收購在我們的目標市場或行業運營的公司，而一些潛在客戶可能會選擇開發自己的內部應用程式。然而，財務管理和人力資本管理領域成功解決方案所需的領域和行業專業知識可能會阻礙新進者，他們也可能無法投入必要的資本來準確滿足全球要求和法規。我們預期產業的持續整合可能會導致競爭顯著加劇。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Subscription Services","val":8833000000,"zh":"訂閱服務"},{"name":"Professional Services","val":719000000,"zh":"專業服務"}],"total":9552000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":7176000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Non Us","val":2376000000,"zh":"非我們"}],"total":9552000000}},"peers":["NOW","TEAM","OKTA","TWLO","ZS"]}}